1
00:00:00,120 --> 00:00:01,590
Şimdi Hegel'in en

2
00:00:01,590 --> 00:00:02,370
ünlü sahnesine

3
00:00:02,370 --> 00:00:03,010
gelelim.

4
00:00:03,010 --> 00:00:03,930
İki bilinç

5
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:04,710
karşılaşır.

6
00:00:04,710 --> 00:00:05,830
Her biri tek

7
00:00:05,830 --> 00:00:06,730
bir şey ister:

8
00:00:06,770 --> 00:00:07,890
ötekinin onu

9
00:00:07,890 --> 00:00:08,610
tanıması.

10
00:00:08,610 --> 00:00:09,830
"Ben varım,

11
00:00:09,830 --> 00:00:10,920
ben değerliyim;

12
00:00:11,070 --> 00:00:12,050
bunu bana sen

13
00:00:12,050 --> 00:00:12,390
söyle."

14
00:00:12,390 --> 00:00:14,390
Bu istek,

15
00:00:14,390 --> 00:00:15,350
bir ölüm kalım

16
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:16,030
mücadelesine

17
00:00:16,030 --> 00:00:16,590
