24
00:00:24,010 --> 00:00:24,590
olurdu.

25
00:00:24,590 --> 00:00:26,130
Ama Hegel ters

26
00:00:26,130 --> 00:00:26,810
köşe yapar.

27
00:00:26,810 --> 00:00:27,630
Efendi,

28
00:00:27,630 --> 00:00:29,110
tanınmayı özgür bir

29
00:00:29,110 --> 00:00:29,930
