41
00:00:41,130 --> 00:00:41,850
dünyayı

42
00:00:41,850 --> 00:00:42,390
biçimlendirir.

43
00:00:42,390 --> 00:00:43,770
Ve dünyayı

44
00:00:43,770 --> 00:00:44,650
biçimlendirirken

45
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:45,470
kendini de

46
00:00:45,470 --> 00:00:46,270
biçimlendirir.

47
00:00:46,270 --> 00:00:48,070
Sonunda özgürlüğe

48
00:00:48,070 --> 00:00:48,930
giden yolu bulan

49
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:49,850
efendi değil,

50
00:00:49,850 --> 00:00:51,290
